      "content": "thanks but i feel like people only say that to make themselves feel better. it's just... i've been thinking about the logic of it all. if everything is just random and there's no inherent meaning to anything, then the value of staying alive vs. not living is basically zero, right? it's like a zero-sum game. if nothing matters, then why is one choice \"better\" than the other?",
